# Test tag for the Hermes Agent evaluation (design/hermes-agent-llm-eval-plan.md, step 4).
# Same weights as hermes3; only the defaults below change. The base model is left as it is.
# Create: ollama create hermes3-64k -f experiments/hermes_agent/modelfiles/hermes3-64k.Modelfile
FROM hermes3
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_predict 1024
